  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Target:</strong> a tool, key, or other item used to interact with objects<br>\n<strong>Disable Device DC:</strong> 25</p>\n<p>You sabotage the target to subtly sabotage other items. Any effect caused by the sabotaged item is just as hard to notice as your original sabotage.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A key can apply any simple or disastrous sabotage of your choice to the lock or a portal the lock is set in.</li>\n<li>A tool produces faulty work with the broken condition that seems fine.</li>\n<li>Another item breaks items it is used with. To break an item, your Disable Device result must be at least 20 + item’s hardness.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/infiltration#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
